YamlD third-party notices
=========================

YamlD is an independent implementation written from the YAML 1.2.2 specification
(https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/) and the YAML 1.1 merge key type (https://yaml.org/type/merge.html).
Its public API follows the design of System.Text.Json (Utf8JsonReader / JsonDocument / JsonSerializer);
no System.Text.Json source code is included.

libyaml
-------
The tokenizer and the event parser follow the structure of the libyaml scanner and parser
(simple-key tracking, indentation stack, token queue and the parser state machine), re-expressed for
UTF-8 byte spans and extended for YAML 1.2.2. libyaml is distributed under the MIT license:

